  "cover_text": "Headed over to the O.co Coliseum for the Oakland Raiders home game on May 29, 2000. Note that it was originally delivered on May 28, 2000 and showed up last night, but it's not part of the show (.ics) alert format.\nBut if there's a new source for the MLS Soccer Network broadcast afterwards, writers need to give it a word. There's onMatch, a news site combining our total MLS coverage right after. Check them out; we broke, qualified the MLS websites yesterday morning and received great feedback.\nYeah, on season. It just concludes right on time. But that's a NAFTA",
